# data/ directory
# ----------------
# This directory stores CSV files generated by generate_sensor_data.py
# during each Airflow DAG run.
#
# File naming convention:
#   sensor_readings_YYYYMMDDHHMM.csv
#
# These files are git-ignored (see .gitignore) as they are runtime artefacts.
# The generate_sensor_data task creates them automatically.
